{"a":[23,24],"h":"<p>23.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"329\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 329.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 25.4 25.4 37.4 44.2 44.2 51.7 51.7 60.0 75.7 75.7 84.7 84.7 96.7 96.7 96.7 103.4 111.0 111.0 126.7 126.7 135.7 135.7 142.4 142.4 149.2 156.0 175.4 189.0 189.0 198.0 198.0 205.4 221.2 221.2 230.2 230.2 242.2 242.2 242.2 249.0 268.4 268.4 277.4 277.4 289.4 289.4 297.0 297.0 304.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"60.0 103.4 149.2 156.0 198.0 249.0 304.4 312.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve işte bu sizin rabbınıza zannettiğiniz zannınızdır ki sizi helâk etti - bu zann Allah hakkında yanlış olan sui zandır ki mühliktir. Demişlerdir ki «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"219\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 218.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 10.6 10.6 18.0 18.0 33.7 33.7 33.7 44.3 54.7 72.0 72.0 84.0 84.0 90.7 90.7 106.6 106.6 106.6 117.0 136.6 136.6 147.0 153.7 153.7 160.6 180.0 180.0 180.0 190.6 190.6 201.0 208.6\" y=\"25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"44.3 54.7 117.0 153.7 160.6 190.6 208.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » zann ikidir biri münci biri mühliktir. «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"165\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 164.5 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 14.2 14.2 30.0 43.4 52.4 52.4 59.2 77.2 77.2 77.2 87.7 107.2 116.2 116.2 123.0 123.0 141.0 147.7 154.4\" y=\"25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"59.2 87.7 107.2 147.7 154.4\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » hadîsi kudsîsinin ma'nâsını yanlış telakkı etmemelidir. Haseni Basrî Hazretleri bu âyeti okumuş da demiştir ki: nâsın ameli rablarına olan zanlarına göredir, Mü'min Allaha güzel zanda bulunur, güzel amel yapar, kâfir ve münafık da kötü zanda bulunur kötü amel yaparlar. 24.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"178\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 178.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 27.0 33.7 33.7 40.4 47.2 47.2 54.0 54.0 63.0 63.0 70.4 86.2 96.7 96.7 112.4 112.4 121.4 121.4 139.4 146.2 155.2\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 40.4 86.2 146.2 155.2 162.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> artık onlar arzularına irdirilecek, döndürülecek değildirler. - Bir hadîsi nebevîde «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"190\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 190.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 19.4 26.2 26.2 33.0 39.7 51.7 51.7 67.4 67.4 84.0 84.0 92.2 101.2 101.2 108.7 124.4 133.4 133.4 140.2 173.2 173.2 180.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"19.4 33.0 39.7 92.2 124.4 140.2 156.0 156.0 180.0\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » buyurulmuştur. Öldükten sonra geri çevrilecek yoktur. </p>"}